    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✓ Brighten your smile on the go.<br\/><br\/>✓ Pocket and purse size making it travel friendly.<br\/><br\/>✓ No irritation.<br\/><br\/>✓ Applies in under 1 minute for a brighter-looking smile<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to apply the Teeth Whitening Pen",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Pull the cover off until you see the white brush.<\/p><p>2. Smile wide and stroke the brush along the front and the bottom of the teeth.<\/p><p>3. Allow the gel to dissolve naturally on your teeth. <\/p><p>4. For best results don't eat or drink for at least 15 minutes post treatment. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Each package includes 1 teeth whitening pen & a user manual<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "323f17c4-396f-42a2-9799-9687f16d089e": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Glycerin, Aqua (Water), PVP, Ethylcellulose, Alcohol, Sodium Polyacrylate, Xylitol, Phthalimidoperoxycaproic Acid, Potassium Citrate, Hydroxyapatite, Rebaudioside A, Menthol, Sodium Citrate, Xanthan Gum, PVM\/MA Copolymer, C12-15 Pareth-3.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Teeth Whitening Pen be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Teeth Whitening Pen is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. While it effectively brightens your natural teeth, it also helps to reduce surface stains on dental restorations. The pen’s formula is gentle and safe, ensuring that your composite bonding, veneers, and fillings are maintained while enhancing the overall appearance of your smile.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cons of not using an Ultra Sonic Tooth Cleaner",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Bad dental hygiene can be devastating on teeth and gums. Not only can it be expensive, but it can also lead to bad breath, gum disease, receding gums, dental decay, and even tooth loss.<\/p><p>This product may also be reffered to as one of the following:<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Calculus remover, Dental irrigator, Dental scaler, Oral irrigator, Plaque remover, Tartar removal tool, Tartar remover, Tooth cleaner, Tooth stain remover, Ultrasonic dental cleaner, Ultrasonic scaler, Ultrasonic tooth cleaner.<\/em><\/p><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
